<% set_meta_tags title: "Support Bowda",
                  description: "Bowda is free, with no ads. About £75 a year keeps it online — here's where that goes." %>
<% set_meta_tags og: { type: "website", image: image_url("support-potato.jpg") } %>

<% costs = [
  { name: "A small server to run the site", amount: 55,
    detail: "A rented computer in a data centre that stays switched on, has a fast connection and is backed up automatically every day." },
  { name: "The bowda.rocks address", amount: 13,
    detail: "Bowda's own web address, so it no longer has to borrow a corner of someone's personal website." },
  { name: "Spare copies and a little headroom", amount: 7,
    detail: "A second copy of the photos and problem data kept somewhere else, plus a bit spare in case the maps or photos outgrow their free allowances." }
] %>
<% donation_url = support_donation_url %>

<main class="bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-16 pb-10 sm:pt-24">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-warm-gray-500">Support Bowda</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl">
      Help give Bowda a home of its own
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-warm-gray-600">
      Bowda is free to use, has no adverts and doesn't track you. It's run by volunteers, and nobody is paid for their time.
      It does cost a little to keep online, though: about <strong class="text-gray-900">£75 a year</strong>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
      <% if donation_url %>
        <%= link_to donation_url, class: "inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-[44px] rounded-lg bg-granite px-5 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-90", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" do %>
          ☕ Buy Bowda a coffee
        <% end %>
        <span class="text-sm text-warm-gray-500">Any amount helps. Opens Ko-fi in a new tab.</span>
      <% else %>
        <p class="text-base text-warm-gray-600">
          Donations open soon. In the meantime you can get in touch at
          <%= link_to "bowda@edsouthwood.com", "mailto:bowda@edsouthwood.com", class: "font-medium underline text-granite" %>.
        </p>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<div class="bg-warm-gray-50">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-warm-gray-900">Where Bowda lives right now</h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-warm-gray-600">
      At the moment the whole site runs on an old computer in Ed's house, on a spare corner of his personal website.
      It works, but when the power or the internet drops at home, the guide goes down with it.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-warm-gray-600">
      It would be nice to give Bowda its own space: a small, proper server that stays on, and its own address,
      <strong class="text-gray-900">bowda.rocks</strong>.
    </p>

    <figure class="mt-8">
      <%= image_tag "support-potato.jpg",
            alt: "The Bowda home page on a monitor, with a potato in the foreground with two USB cables plugged into it",
            width: 1400, height: 1050, loading: "lazy",
            class: "w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-sm" %>
      <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-warm-gray-500">
        Bowda's current hosting setup. Well, nearly: it's really an old computer, but it isn't much more glamorous than this.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-warm-gray-900">What £75 a year pays for</h2>

    <dl class="mt-8 divide-y divide-warm-gray-200 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm">
      <% costs.each do |cost| %>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 sm:p-6">
          <div class="flex-1">
            <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900"><%= cost[:name] %></dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-base text-warm-gray-600"><%= cost[:detail] %></dd>
          </div>
          <dd class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 tabular-nums">about £<%= cost[:amount] %></dd>
        </div>
      <% end %>
      <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 sm:p-6">
        <dt class="flex-1 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Total per year</dt>
        <dd class="shrink-0 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 tabular-nums">£<%= costs.sum { |c| c[:amount] } %></dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <p class="mt-6 text-base text-warm-gray-600">
      That works out at about £6 a month, or nineteen £4 coffees for the whole year.
      Every penny goes on running costs, and anything left over goes towards the following year.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-warm-gray-900">Other ways to help</h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-warm-gray-600">
      Money isn't the only way to help. Photos, new problems and corrections make the guide better for everyone, and you can
      <%= link_to "contribute", contribute_path, class: "font-medium underline text-granite" %> any time.
      Telling your climbing friends about Bowda helps too.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
